@pass drop NBT `CreativeOxidationStage:"weathered"`, `CreativeOxidationWaxed:1b`; placed pipe `exposed,waxed=true`; both door halves `oxidized`; coin stack block `weathered`; with the option off the drop carries no `CreativeOxidation` key
@fails no NBT on the drop: the BlockStateBase.getDrops mixin did not apply or OxidationTargets.isTargetItem missed the item; placed plain: BlockItemMixin (place / placeBlock refmap); only the lower door half: OxidationManager.restorePlaced half lookup; coin stack plain: OxidationEvents.onBlockPlaced (EntityPlaceEvent not fired for CoinStackItem)
