## SQ-OXD-16 | staged and waxed items work as the plain item in recipes (R15)
@group A
@commands Encase a Fluid Pipe by `cdevtest use` with an oxidized Copper Casing stack; `cdevtest uses create:fluid_pipe` lists its recipes; LOOK: craft a Mechanical Pump from a weathered waxed Fluid Pipe and a cogwheel at a crafting table, and a Mechanical Crafter recipe with an oxidized Copper Casing
@pass the pipe becomes `create:encased_fluid_pipe` and the casing is used up; crafting and mechanical crafting accept the staged items (LOOK)
@fails casing refused: Create's encasing compares the stack with NBT (not expected in 0.5.1); a recipe refuses a staged item: a strict-NBT ingredient names it (the P3 recipe check found none, plan section 6)
