> cdevtest use 0 100 148 held=create:copper_casing{CreativeOxidationStage:'oxidized',CreativeOxidationWaxed:0b} face=north stand=0,100,146
expect verb=use who=fake hand=main action=block result=(SUCCESS|CONSUME)
