## CQ-OXD-02 | names: "Waxed Weathered Fluid Pipe"; anvil rename shows the rename (R3)
@group client
@commands `/give @p create:fluid_pipe{CreativeOxidationStage:"weathered",CreativeOxidationWaxed:1b}` and `create:copper_casing{CreativeOxidationStage:"exposed"}`; hover each; rename the pipe "Line A" in an anvil; hover; take a plain Fluid Pipe
@pass tooltips read "Waxed Weathered Fluid Pipe" and "Exposed Copper Casing", not italic; the renamed pipe reads "Line A" (italic, as any rename); the plain pipe reads "Fluid Pipe"; the item NBT has no `display.Name` before the rename
@fails plain name on the staged items: ItemStackMixin (getHoverName, `m_41786_`) not applied or the lang keys missing from the nested jar; rename ignored: the mixin overrides custom names (hasCustomHoverName check)
@draft needs a client: give, hover screenshots and an anvil rename by the client driver

