## SQ-OXD-12 | spout and fan: plain pipe -> exposed; weathered -> oxidized; waxed not accepted; a staged item not taken by the plain recipe
@group A
@commands `cdevtest rdetail` on the staged pipe recipes; three fan lanes with a plain, a weathered and a waxed exposed Fluid Pipe item; LOOK: a Spout over a Depot with water, a plain and a weathered pipe
@pass boot log has no recipe parse error naming `creativeoxidation`; rdetail lists `staged/create/fluid_pipe_exposed` by `create:filling` and `create:splashing`; the plain pipe item becomes `CreativeOxidationStage:"exposed"` (not weathered in one pass), the weathered one `"oxidized"`, the waxed exposed pipe is unchanged (`exposed`, `CreativeOxidationWaxed:1b`); LOOK: the Spout turns a plain pipe exposed and a weathered one oxidized, 250 mB each
@fails parse error on `creativeoxidation:staged`: StagedIngredient serializer not registered before recipes load (CraftingHelper.register in the constructor); unknown recipe: aging.js not in the Engineering jar or `// requires: creativeoxidation` failed; the plain pipe goes straight on or the waxed pipe ages: StagedIngredient.matches; a result without NBT: NCH._createNbtRoute not taken (an old Creative Common jar)
bootreject Parsing error loading recipe creativeoxidation:
bootreject Unknown ingredient type.*creativeoxidation
