expect verb=rdetail id=creativeoxidation:createsplashing/copper_block_exposed serializer=create:splashing
> cdevtest rdetail create_oxidized:
> cdevtest rdetail creativecompat:createsplashing/
reject verb=rdetail id=create_oxidized:
reject verb=rdetail id=creativecompat:createsplashing/
> forceload add 0 176 32 192
> fill 0 99 178 30 99 178 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 100 178 create:creative_motor[facing=east]
> setblock 1 100 178 create:encased_fan[facing=east]
> setblock 2 100 178 minecraft:chain[axis=x,waterlogged=true]
> summon minecraft:item 4 100 178 {Item:{id:"minecraft:copper_block",Count:1b},PickupDelay:32767}
sleep 15
> execute positioned 4 100 178 run data get entity @e[type=minecraft:item,limit=1,sort=nearest,distance=..3] Item
expect minecraft:exposed_copper
look Spout over a Depot fed water: a Copper Block, Cut Copper and Create Copper Shingles each come out one stage on with 250 mB
## SQ-OXD-14 | iron rusting: cut iron and iron door by spout and fan, one stage each
@group A
@commands `cdevtest rdetail` on the iron recipes; fan lanes with Cut Iron and an Iron Door; LOOK: a Spout on Cut Iron and an Exposed Iron Door
@pass rdetail lists `creativeoxidation:createfilling/iron/cut_iron_exposed` and `createsplashing/iron/iron_door_exposed` (33 of each, vertical slabs with Quark); Cut Iron becomes Exposed Cut Iron, the Iron Door an Exposed Iron Door (not weathered in one pass); LOOK: the Spout turns Cut Iron exposed and an Exposed Iron Door weathered, 250 mB each
@fails no iron recipes: Immersive Weathering ids missing from the dict (aging.js skips the chain); a vertical slab missing with Quark loaded: the dict key
> cdevtest rdetail creativeoxidation:createfilling/iron/cut_iron_
> cdevtest rdetail creativeoxidation:createsplashing/iron/iron_door_
